    "text": "A glass hemisphere <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>1.5</mtext></mrow></mfenced></math> has a radius of curvature of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>. A small object <em><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></em> is located on its axis halfway between the plane and spherical surface. The distance between two images, when viewed along the axis from the sides of the hemisphere, is<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/3092_ques_111.png\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 104px;\" />",
